index 0000000..c779380
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/placement-threading-service-backend-3f1c2a9d7b4e5a60.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+upgrade:
+  - |
+    The placement service now registers the ``threading`` backend as the
+    default for ``oslo.service``, instead of letting the first import of
+    ``oslo.messaging`` select the ``eventlet`` backend. This stops the
+    placement process loading ``eventlet``, which it does not use. A backend
+    that is selected explicitly before placement is imported is still used.
